{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra Division: RTS/FPS hybrid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heat of battle, where will you be most needed? Expanding your economy at a crucial moment, or taking part in the assault to break the enemy line? <i>Terra Division</i> constantly presents you with this compelling choice, creating a dynamic and deeply rewarding strategic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command your army in realtime</strong> <br>Defend your outposts, manage your economy, and command vast armies from an classic RTS perspective. Outthink and outmaneuver your enemy with complex strategies, combined arms tactics, and superior base management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/0b96bbb4630a82766a7eac930de0c3c4.avif?t=1762634584\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play in First-Person</strong>  <br>Take direct control of any unit on the battlefield. Press a key to become a front-line soldier, a powerful mech pilot, or a tankman. Use your raw FPS skills to aim deadly weapons and activate unique unit abilities at the perfect moment. Your aim matters as much as your strategic plan.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/a606ce984c5ba248bbed751d410a437f.avif?t=1762634584\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Promote and empower your forces</strong>  <br>Your troops are not expendable. They are the elite of the United Earth Federation. Units gain veterancy through combat, unlocking a deep promotion and upgrade system. Transform a basic rifleman into a veteran with advanced gear. Forge your own personalized, unstoppable elite force.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/extras/1046e4510432f65d3abc2fa6e90d03f8.avif?t=1762634584\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your command style is your weapon. Save the humanity for the United Earth Federation!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127880?t=1762634584","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127880?t=1762634584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/04b9c3d4fa6328ec4ff473b0532f76f9662a8211/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762634584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127880/04b9c3d4fa6328ec4ff473b0532f76f9662a8211/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762634584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra Division: RTS/FPS hybrid</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heat of battle, where will you be most needed? Expanding your economy at a crucial moment, or taking part in the assault to break the enemy line? <i>Terra Division</i> constantly presents you with this compelling choice, creating a dynamic and deeply rewarding strategic experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command your army in realtime</strong> <br>Defend your outposts, manage your economy, and command vast armies from an classic RTS perspective. Outthink and outmaneuver your enemy with complex strategies, combined arms tactics, and superior base management.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 